      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " eGFR < 30. Don't start at eGFR 30–45; reassess if eGFR falls below 45. Contraindicated with risk of acidemia (hypoxia, severe respiratory disease, alcohol use disorder, metabolic acidosis, dehydration). Withhold for surgery, IV contrast and serious illness."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
